   "locked": false,
   "text": "- live_mode = False: no LLM key, so the agent and mutation arms all fall back to grid search and the prompt is never read.\n- That is why the 5 agent/mutation arms are identical (paired deltas 0.0, CI [0, 0]): a check that the fallback doesn't fake an LLM effect.\n- Every searching arm lands at 0.000 holdout return on this fixture, while buy-and-hold loses 12%.\n- A real evidence-vs-random comparison needs: python scripts/fair_search_benchmark.py --live  (with ANTHROPIC_API_KEY set).",
   "originalText": "- live_mode = False: no LLM key, so the agent and mutation arms all fall back to grid search and the prompt is never read.\n- That is why the 5 agent/mutation arms are identical (paired deltas 0.0, CI [0, 0]): a check that the fallback doesn't fake an LLM effect.\n- Every searching arm lands at 0.000 holdout return on this fixture, while buy-and-hold loses 12%.\n- A real evidence-vs-random comparison needs: python scripts/fair_search_benchmark.py --live  (with ANTHROPIC_API_KEY set).",
